WEBVTT

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:03.350
Togashi's place?

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.590
Yup! After all, they've shacked up!

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:07.050
Shacked up!

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.610
Don't you want to have a peek?

00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:10.800
Shacking up isn't all that shocking.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:11.940
Enough!

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:15.000
My master merely shares a hideout
with Dark Flame Master

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.850
under the terms of their formal contract.

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:21.620
They are not living the
scandalous life you imagine.

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:23.220
She's right.

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:27.140
And besides, Togashi asked us
not to talk about it at school.

00:00:27.510 --> 00:00:28.790
I know that.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:32.270
But they're in high school!
They're boyfriend and girlfriend!

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:36.180
And they're living together!
Doesn't it bother you?

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:39.830
The only thing that bothers me
is a decrepit non-sorcerer like yourself.

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:43.060
I am busy. Now be quiet.

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:45.240
What are you doing, Deko?

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:48.140
I am creating an adventure log for my fallen

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:51.100
comrades who have retreated
from the front line.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:52.520
Adventure log?

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:56.320
She's assembling lesson notes
for classmates who weren't at school.

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:59.540
All right, you stay behind.

00:01:00.210 --> 00:01:01.830
Are you interested, Kumin?

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:02.930
Hmm...

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:05.470
A couple in love, living together.

00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:07.920
I bet their hearts flutter when they
make eye contact.

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:11.120
I bet they have little cuddles
when nobody's around.

00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:13.850
I'll bet they even sneak kisses
when Little Sister isn't looking.

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:15.880
What? Really?

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:16.510
LOVE LOVE

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:18.090
Well, yeah!

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:18.640
LOVE LOVE LOVE LOVE LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:20.890
Be quiet!

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.390
Be quiet! Be quiet! Be quiet!

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:25.410
So, it does bother you.

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:26.980
It does not!

00:02:57.830 --> 00:03:01.920
The dark wave motions prevent me
from seeing my master.

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:03.300
I cannot see her.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:06.840
Master... Where are you, Master?

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:09.430
Face it. It seriously bothers you.

00:03:09.430 --> 00:03:12.540
You finished off those lesson notes
incredibly fast.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:14.920
Oh! I see Togashi!

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:17.970
You're right! What is he doing?

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:20.270
He's either testing the wind direction...

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:24.640
...or he is ordering the dark ones
to assemble for a new battle.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:26.640
I think...

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:29.520
...he's taking in the laundry.

00:03:29.910 --> 00:03:32.540
I'm sorry. I forgot to take it in.

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:35.400
No, I believe it was Rikka's turn today.

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:38.220
That's all right. I've
always done the laundry.

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:40.890
Dolphin Ring Striker

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:40.970
That won't work. She's
the one who suggested it.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:46.910
BADDY

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:46.910
Yes. The Wicked Lord's chaotic trance
dark hot pot is served.

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:49.860
You're calling it dark hot pot.

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:54.650
Rikka, my big brother and I will take care
of all the cooking from now on.

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:56.180
Understood.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:00.270
Please assign me a different mission.

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:04.440
We only started assigning chores
because of her messes.

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:05.270
Is she here?

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:06.550
She just got in.

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:13.940
You were supposed to die then!

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:15.690
Use the vacuum.

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:17.690
What are you doing in here anyway?

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:20.120
Ooh! Did you buy those?

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.920
I-I did not "buy" anything.

00:04:22.920 --> 00:04:24.380
It was preordained that these
should fall into my hands.

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:26.450
Those are so cool! Let me see!

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:27.460
Sure.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:29.360
Here.

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:30.330
Thanks!

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:34.830
You could use these to
play ghost busters too!

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:36.960
Ooh, you look so cool!

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:38.840
Yuta!

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:41.050
Do your own vacuuming.

00:04:41.890 --> 00:04:46.050
But these must have been expensive.
I'm surprised you had the money.

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:48.550
EVERY WHICH WAY BANK
RIKKA TAKANASHI

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:53.340
Toka mentioned that she'd deposited
your monthly allowance.

00:04:54.910 --> 00:04:57.150
Rikka. No, Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:04:57.620 --> 00:05:00.650
Will you please show me your
gold documentation?

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:04.170
This is my Wicked Lord Shingan's
most secret secret.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:07.530
I cannot disclose that secret, even to you!

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:09.990
Show it to me, Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:13.180
If you open it, all the evil
contained therein will escape

00:05:13.180 --> 00:05:14.710
and spread over the Earth...

00:05:14.930 --> 00:05:16.890
Just show it to me!

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:18.560
Yuta, stop!

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:24.690
What is the meaning of this?

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:26.480
Power Level: 150,000?

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:28.800
He is more powerful than the Priestess!

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:32.470
Apologize to your sister!

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:34.560
You! You!

00:05:32.780 --> 00:05:35.230
Wah, stop!

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:38.660
That's how they act at school.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:40.490
We can't be sure just yet.

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:44.320
After all, couples don't
act lovey-dovey all the time.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:48.040
Hey, someone's moved
into the apartment above.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:50.320
PAKIRA
FRESH MARKET

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:51.960
Were you really planning to ride out

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:54.200
the rest of the month on less than 1000 yen?

00:05:54.590 --> 00:05:57.500
One of Wicked Lord Shingan's abilities
is the empty rupture.

00:05:57.800 --> 00:06:00.560
The magic of Wicked Lord Shingan
who dwells within me...

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:04.020
...can maintain my bodily functions
without nourishment for years...

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:05.870
...enabling life activity.

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.430
NEW PRODUCT!!!
Arabiki Crunchy Sausages

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:08.430
Would you like a sample?

00:06:08.730 --> 00:06:10.420
See? You are hungry.

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:13.350
I'm sorry, I'll take two bags.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:18.410
Going out to shop together for food
for supper is much more romantic.

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:19.480
We're going in.

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:20.890
You're dragging me down.

00:06:20.890 --> 00:06:23.860
A sign said 'no roller skates in the store.'

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:27.490
My foe could attack at any time,
but I'm ready for them.

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:30.780
I will topple that pile of
candy and block them off.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:33.010
And then I will immediately
destroy the lighting.

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:35.240
And when they have been blinded,
I'll finish them with this.

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:38.040
Offense and defense as one!

00:06:38.470 --> 00:06:39.540
Don't do it, ever!

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:42.640
Look how late it is. Let's go.

00:06:42.640 --> 00:06:43.380
Wait.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:44.380
CUMIN

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:45.630
Kumin!

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:48.260
Yuta, we must purchase Kumin.

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:51.910
We don't need any. Put it back.

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:55.350
What? C'mon, we need to buy Kumin!

00:06:55.860 --> 00:06:57.700
Rikka is so cute.

00:06:57.700 --> 00:07:00.400
What about Dekomori?
Maybe they have Dekomori!

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:02.600
You're not a spice, dummy.

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:06.860
These are cumin seeds.
Effective for putting monsters to sleep.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:10.040
Cumin is used for making curry.

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:12.800
We don't make authentic curry at our house.

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:15.120
The usual roux cubes will suffice.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:17.680
Do you have something against Kumin?

00:07:17.680 --> 00:07:20.880
I never said that. C'mon, we're going.

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:27.760
She seems to have split up with Togashi.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:29.840
What is she staring at?

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:32.610
Today, I will have the blue crystal.

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:33.260
MYSTERY JEWEL

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:35.440
Are you done? Let's go.

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:47.990
Yuta, I must go to verify the
condition of a singularity.

00:07:47.990 --> 00:07:49.030
At your leave.

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:50.550
What, now?

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.780
Make it back home by supper time.

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:55.040
I swear it on the name of
the Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:07:58.780 --> 00:08:00.650
My Master summons me!

00:08:00.650 --> 00:08:03.250
I'm on my way! Dekomori is on her way!

00:08:04.970 --> 00:08:08.020
It's so nice that they're such good friends.

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:10.560
Although they didn't look that lovey-dovey.

00:08:10.560 --> 00:08:12.150
That's the problem.

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:12.590
Huh?

00:08:12.810 --> 00:08:14.430
They've been going out for six months.

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:17.810
This is the time most couples are
supposed to be at their busiest.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:18.970
Really?

00:08:19.150 --> 00:08:22.730
But look at the state of them. I suspect...

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:24.770
...marital burnout!

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:27.190
Burnout paradise!

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:30.190
That hurt, Morisummer.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:31.880
You're supposed to respect your senpai.

00:08:31.880 --> 00:08:34.630
But really, you're burning out.

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:35.740
So you say.

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:38.200
How do you feel about Takanashi?

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:39.030
In what way?

00:08:39.260 --> 00:08:41.180
You're boyfriend and girlfriend, aren't you?

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:43.500
You've sounded out your feelings
for one another, haven't you?

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:45.790
Well, yeah, sure.

00:08:45.930 --> 00:08:48.810
Don't you feel excitement
when you're together?

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:51.170
Don't you hold hands and
gaze into one another's eyes?

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:53.530
T-that has nothing to do with you.

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:55.180
Just tell me.

00:08:55.560 --> 00:08:58.930
She hasn't changed a bit in the last year.

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:02.630
And you seem totally oblivious too.

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:03.680
Oblivious?!

00:09:04.070 --> 00:09:05.950
I spied on you two yesterday...

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:08.370
...and you looked more like father
and daughter than a couple.

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:10.410
More like grampa and grandkid.

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:13.070
Who are you calling grampa?
You were tailing us?!

00:09:13.260 --> 00:09:15.670
So, you don't like cumin, huh?

00:09:15.790 --> 00:09:17.000
What are you talking about?!

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:20.380
You've shacked up! Togashi,
you're living with your girlfriend!

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:25.000
Don't you ever bill and
coo like normal couples?

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:29.180
I think you're wrong about
the marital burnout thing.

00:09:29.180 --> 00:09:30.000
Why?

00:09:30.520 --> 00:09:34.440
Because that refers to a couple growing
dispassionate about one another.

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:36.110
In our case, me and Rikka,

00:09:36.110 --> 00:09:38.590
we haven't even gotten to
the hand-holding stage.

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:42.100
Wha-?

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:43.600
Really!

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:46.490
Yeah. So, the marital burnout thing...

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:48.580
...really doesn't apply to us.

00:09:49.870 --> 00:09:51.700
Yuta Togashi.

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.980
Why does that make you so angry anyway?!

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:55.680
When did you start going out?

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:57.360
Last fall.

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.840
When did you go on a boat date?

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:00.490
Christmas.

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:03.260
So, you're saying that New Year's Eve
and Valentine's Day went by...

00:10:03.260 --> 00:10:04.970
...and you still haven't
even held hands yet?!

00:10:04.970 --> 00:10:06.050
You're choking me, Nibutani.

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:07.040
Come with me!

00:10:07.510 --> 00:10:09.250
Wait! Wait, Nibutani!

00:10:09.430 --> 00:10:11.470
Togashi, look what they did to me.

00:10:11.470 --> 00:10:12.130
Move it!

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.860
This is Kazari Kannagi!

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:28.310
Hello, my name is Kazari.

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:29.060
Oh.

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:32.450
Kannagi knows everything to do with romance.

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:34.490
I'm sure she'll give you good advice.

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:36.070
Wait, what are you talking about?

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:39.960
I told you to keep me and Rikka
living together a secret.

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:42.960
I know that. I didn't tell her that.

00:10:42.960 --> 00:10:46.950
I only told her that your love life
isn't going so well.

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:50.370
Rikka is your girlfriend, right?

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:53.900
Huh? Uh, well, it's kind of...

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:55.300
Why hide it?

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:58.250
You two have been famous
ever since Year One.

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:00.800
I see, so you're having problems with Rikka.

00:11:01.020 --> 00:11:02.390
This could be my big chance.

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:03.010
Pardon?

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:07.630
I actually like girls.
And I'm infatuated with Rikka.

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:11.400
I didn't tell her because if she found out,
that would be the end of it.

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:14.520
You're my rival? I hope
that is the end of it!

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:16.650
But all joking aside...

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:18.240
That was a joke?

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:21.110
For now, please give me your cell phone.

00:11:22.670 --> 00:11:23.200
Sure.

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:25.510
The best thing to do is ask her on a date,

00:11:25.510 --> 00:11:28.580
set the right mood, and see how she reacts.

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:30.720
Wait, what are you doing with my phone?!

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:33.560
I'm sending mail. "Will you please go out
on a date with me this Sunday?"

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:34.060
What?!

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:36.560
"I have something important to talk
to you about." Send.

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:38.090
Hey!

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:44.010
That was kind of exciting because
it was like telling Rikka I love her.

00:11:44.280 --> 00:11:45.150
Look here!

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:47.150
We may look calm...

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:50.360
...but every girl waits for the boy
to make the first move.

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:51.940
Even Rikka?

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:53.940
I could be wrong.

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:58.070
Takanashi can't say what's on her mind,
partly due to her syndrome.

00:11:58.330 --> 00:12:01.070
You need to coax her out of her shell.

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:04.000
Well, yeah, you could have a point.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.380
Sender: Rikka Takanashi
ROGER THAT.

00:12:08.170 --> 00:12:11.640
And so, Rikka and I,
albeit unintentionally...

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.540
...made a date for Sunday.

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:18.340
Good morning, Water Dragon.

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:19.800
Good morning.

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:21.920
Rikka, that's so cute.

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:25.890
The use of this robe is only permitted
for special ceremonies.

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:29.850
Really? Is something special happening today?

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:39.160
Okay, let's go.

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:41.150
Tell me first. What is our destination?

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:45.780
Well, it's a place you
kind of wanted to visit.

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:47.140
I did?

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:50.050
Gasp! Are you reading my thoughts?!

00:12:50.050 --> 00:12:53.250
No! Just wait and see.

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:54.670
Got a firm grip?

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:58.680
Releasing evil skill formula.
Deployment prep complete.

00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:01.220
Yuta, we have a green light. Go!

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:03.730
But slowly.

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:04.680
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:09.600
How is it? You okay?

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:12.600
No problem, other than poor visibility.

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:15.200
There's nothing we can
do about your visibility.

00:13:15.740 --> 00:13:17.860
I need to concentrate on safe driving.

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:21.320
Don't worry. Your death is also my death.

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:23.000
You're scaring me.

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:26.290
And besides, the Wicked Lord
Shingan is all-powerful!

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:28.880
He allows me to see everything,
despite my visibility.

00:13:29.550 --> 00:13:31.620
I can even see into your soul.

00:13:31.970 --> 00:13:34.100
That's the first time you
mentioned that ability.

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:39.450
Right now, you are thinking,
"Whoa! I'm breaking the sound barrier!"

00:13:39.450 --> 00:13:42.690
"I am a virtual whirlwind of
lightning speed!" Right?

00:13:44.230 --> 00:13:45.300
I am not!

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:46.880
Oh! Look!

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:49.970
Wind turbines.

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:51.900
Ha!

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:52.720
What are you doing?

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:55.360
I will rotate the windmills using dark power!

00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:58.240
Join me, Yuta!

00:13:58.240 --> 00:13:59.360
That won't work.

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:03.030
Don't worry. We just need to unite
our dark powers as one!

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:05.190
Will this do?

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:08.000
Wicked Lord Fire Dragon wave motion!

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:09.620
C'mon, let's go.

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:14.470
I saw an internet video showing a windmill
being destroyed by gale-force winds.

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:20.630
SAZANAMI AQUARIUM

00:14:20.930 --> 00:14:23.610
Ooh. It's the reincarnation of R'lyeh.

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:28.110
Remember how you said
you wanted to see a real dolphin?

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:32.280
Mister Kyle is a genius.
He is in the form of a fish...

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:35.280
...but I suspect he is actually
a dark warrior in disguise.

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.270
I haven't seen him around recently.

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:39.810
My dear Ancient Kings.

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:45.250
We may look calm...

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:48.880
...but every girl waits for the boy
to make the first move.

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:52.560
Rikka...

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:58.310
Listen. Since we're here,
just the two of us...

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:00.370
...would you like to hold hands?

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:04.770
Uh, you don't have to if you're too shy.

00:15:04.770 --> 00:15:06.850
It's just that we've only touched pinkies...

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:09.470
...since we started going out.

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:34.160
Wow, penguins! Penguins!

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:35.420
Nautilus!

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:37.540
No, no. "Nau-t-lus."

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:41.790
I once seriously wanted to attend
Miskatonic University...

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:45.790
...but the Mu civilization was never
an existing continent.

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:52.770
And Mister Kyle only existed
in the Japanese version.

00:15:52.770 --> 00:15:53.760
What? For real?

00:15:54.150 --> 00:15:55.250
Such incredible speed.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:57.180
The speed to tear through magical dimensions.

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:03.830
Now, if you would like to give signals to
the dolphin, show me your flippers!

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:05.940
Me! Me!

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:07.440
All right, that girl there.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:08.420
Coming!

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:12.030
Will you please tell us
your name and your age?

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:15.590
I... I'm Rikka Takanashi. I'm...

00:16:16.510 --> 00:16:17.990
I'm in grade six.

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:19.720
Don't tell her that!

00:16:21.340 --> 00:16:25.080
Look hard at the dolphin's face,
and sway your head from side to side.

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:28.020
Calm down, Dolphin!

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:30.350
Are you okay? Shall I dry your face?

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:31.880
I'm fine!

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:35.270
Okay, next let's get the
training lady teach you...

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:37.850
...how to give the signal to jump.

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:40.360
First, point upward with your right hand.

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:44.310
Next, touch your right hand
to your left shoulder.

00:16:44.410 --> 00:16:47.580
To give the signal, we will count to three...

00:16:47.580 --> 00:16:50.480
...and then you must raise your right hand.

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:53.740
Let's begin. One, two, three!

00:16:58.420 --> 00:17:00.670
The dolphin is at my bidding!

00:17:00.670 --> 00:17:01.750
Cut it out, silly!

00:17:04.600 --> 00:17:05.850
Come on, diving beetle!

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:09.090
Oh! A Japanese giant salamander!

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:21.350
That wasn't much different
from the norm either.

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:24.020
You need to coax her out of her shell.

00:17:24.660 --> 00:17:26.900
I'm sure she's right, but...

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:30.330
I'm here.

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:31.910
Shakey shake!

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:33.650
I'll let you have this with it.

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:36.680
This returns from vending machines
every single time.

00:17:37.170 --> 00:17:38.620
The Chosen 10 yen coin!

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:43.180
Hey, I don't get excited
about every little thing!

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:44.200
Uh-oh. Did I miss?

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:47.810
But it isn't a serrated
10 yen coin after all.

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:52.050
It's so old, the edge got smoothed down.

00:17:52.690 --> 00:17:57.010
Poor thing. You have lost
your place in the world.

00:17:57.360 --> 00:18:00.530
It has merely lost its place in the
vending machine system.

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:02.210
It's still good currency.

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:06.840
But then it would lose its
predominance as the Chosen One.

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:08.020
Make up your mind.

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:10.360
Today was fun, huh?

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:12.710
A dolphin tore through the darkness!

00:18:13.210 --> 00:18:14.830
And we even held hands.

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:17.770
Y-yeah. I'll hold hands.

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:19.980
All you can hold, hand-holding!

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:21.280
Sure.

00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:25.540
But I still don't understand it that well.

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:30.150
I made the love pact with you,
so we are boyfriend and girlfriend.

00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:34.270
But I still don't have the
slightest idea what lovers are.

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:38.970
Thinking about it makes my head confused.

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:40.260
Rikka.

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:44.820
Now that we are lovers,
regular physical contact is inevitable!

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:46.280
Th-that's true.

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:47.700
However...

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:48.480
Which is it?

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:49.980
I don't know.

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:54.710
I searched for the meaning of lovers...

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:56.790
...but it's still unclear to me.

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:59.670
I searched the net, but it was gibberish.

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:02.580
What does "Common-law couples are not

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:04.750
necessarily designated as lovers" even mean?!

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:07.370
It's totally different from my contract
with Wicked Lord Shingan.

00:19:07.890 --> 00:19:11.210
Do you mean you didn't want the love pact?

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:13.520
I didn't say that! I do want it!

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:14.540
I'm happy about it!

00:19:15.140 --> 00:19:17.690
But I don't know what I should be doing.

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:21.220
Although I'm certain
that something must change.

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:27.690
I can say one thing with certainty.

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:30.350
A fun day is coming to an end.

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:35.860
We will soon go home.
Together to the same place.

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:41.610
Nothing could make me happier.

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:47.830
So happy in fact, that I fear I've peaked,
and am now marked for death.

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:49.580
Hey,

00:19:50.380 --> 00:19:51.460
it's turning!

00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:56.540
Our powers worked on it.

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:01.470
The Wicked Lord Shingan
is definitely invincible!

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:04.720
Oh! But The Dark Flame Master
is second-most invincible.

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:09.180
Yuta?

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:14.040
Sorry, it isn't that.

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:21.360
I am impressed, Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:24.490
You are indeed the one, I,
Dark Flame Master, expected you to be!

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:27.730
The contract you and I are bound to

00:20:27.730 --> 00:20:30.460
is not the so-called lover's
pact of the mundanes!

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:33.080
It is the lover's pact of
the Wicked Lord Shingan!

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:35.750
Therefore, we need not feel
the obligation to be manipulated

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:39.260
by the so-called conventional
wisdom of commoners!

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:43.550
We may fulfill our contract as we see fit!

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:46.250
I am certain we can fulfill this pact!

00:20:46.690 --> 00:20:50.110
For we are the Wicked Lord Shingan
and Dark Flame Master!

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:52.940
Yuta.

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:56.730
So, what do you think?

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:58.610
Sure.

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:03.030
You turned the windmills and came home?

00:21:03.460 --> 00:21:05.660
That doesn't make any sense.

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:08.460
And you're really okay with that?

00:21:08.460 --> 00:21:09.370
Yeah.

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:13.090
I think that Rikka still needs to be Rikka.

00:21:14.090 --> 00:21:15.530
I feel a lot better now.

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:20.230
Well, if you're okay with it.

00:21:20.770 --> 00:21:22.800
But Kannagi gave me some advice.

00:21:23.350 --> 00:21:25.900
She said that if a couple keeps
putting everything off...

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:29.760
...it nearly always gives an interloper
the chance to come between them.

00:21:34.530 --> 00:21:36.770
Oof, oof.

00:21:59.680 --> 00:22:01.730
Wanna see my magic?

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:06.050
To be Continued
